Contract: SDD

Purpose:
  Contract testing — verify that service-to-service contracts are
  honored. Contract tests ensure that providers and consumers agree
  on the API schema and behavior, enabling independent deployment.

Owns: ./

Scope:
  Provider contracts (what the service provides)
  Consumer contracts (what the consumer expects)
  Message schemas (events, commands, queries)
  Schema evolution and compatibility

Principles:
  Contracts are shared agreements, not implementation details
  Provider and consumer tests are separate
  Contract changes require coordination
  Breaking changes must be versioned

Structure:
  Every contract MUST define:
    request/response schema
    error responses
    authentication requirements
    rate limiting constraints
    versioning strategy

Frameworks:
  Pact (provider/consumer)
  Spring Cloud Contract
  Schemathesis (OpenAPI)
  GraphQL schema testing

Navigation:
  Project: @project/project.sdd
  Workflow: @workflow/testing.sdd
  TestLevels: @levels.sdd
  TestTypes: @types.sdd
  TestGates: @gates.sdd
